  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 1462,
      "text": "There had never been any town that believed [after seeing the punishment] and benefited from its faith except the people of Jonah[65]. When they believed, We removed from them the punishment of disgrace in the life of this world, and let them enjoy themselves for a while.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 98,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 220,
      "ruku": 181,
      "hizbQuarter": 88,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1463,
      "text": "Had your Lord willed, all those on earth would have believed altogether. Will you then compel people to become believers?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 99,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 220,
      "ruku": 181,
      "hizbQuarter": 88,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1464,
      "text": "No soul can believe except by Allah’s will, and He will bring disgrace upon those who do not use their intellect.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 100,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 220,
      "ruku": 181,
      "hizbQuarter": 88,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1465,
      "text": "Say, “Look at what is in the heavens and earth.” But the signs and warnings are of no avail to those who do not believe.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 101,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 220,
      "ruku": 181,
      "hizbQuarter": 88,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1466,
      "text": "Are they waiting except for the same punishment that befell those who came before them? Say, “Then wait. I too am waiting with you.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 102,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 220,
      "ruku": 181,
      "hizbQuarter": 88,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1467,
      "text": "Then We will save Our messengers and those who believe. For We took it upon Us to save the believers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 103,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 220,
      "ruku": 181,
      "hizbQuarter": 88,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1468,
      "text": "Say [O Prophet], “O people, if you are in doubt about my religion, then I do not worship those whom you worship besides Allah. But I worship Allah, Who causes you to die, and I have been commanded to be one of the believers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 104,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 220,
      "ruku": 182,
      "hizbQuarter": 88,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1469,
      "text": "And be steadfast and exclusively devoted to true faith, and never be of those who associate partners with Allah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 105,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 220,
      "ruku": 182,
      "hizbQuarter": 88,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1470,
      "text": "Do not supplicate[66] besides Allah that which can neither benefit nor harm you, for if you do so, you will be one of the wrongdoers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
